Modifications relative to the original
--------------------------------------

  * Translated from Java to TypeScript.
  * Removed dependency on Eclipse / Xtext / GWT runtime infrastructure.
  * Replaced Java collections with native TypeScript / JavaScript
    equivalents.
  * Introduces a human hint system that influences layout decisions
    beyond ELK's existing constraint vocabulary. [Document substantive
    changes here as the port progresses.]

Components NOT ported
---------------------

The following components of ELK are intentionally excluded from this
port because they are licensed under terms incompatible with EPL-2.0
or rely on native code that cannot be reasonably ported:

  * OGDF integration (GPL-licensed C++ library)
  * libavoid edge routing (LGPL-licensed C++ library)

